{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And she bore him Zimran.</b> She raised them in his house, after the manner of the five sons of Michal whom she bore to Adriel (II Samuel 21:8) — whom she raised though they were not her children at all. For indeed Abraham begot none but Isaac and Ishmael, as is explained in the book of Chronicles (I Chronicles 1:28, 32)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "Sforno reads ותלד here as 'raised/reared,' not physical begetting, citing the analogous case of Michal and Adriel's sons in II Samuel 21:8."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:36.175877762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}